Syntax

Usually Snowflake manages generation internally.

Typical multi-cluster syntax remains:

CREATE WAREHOUSE bi_wh
WITH
WAREHOUSE_SIZE = 'MEDIUM'
MIN_CLUSTER_COUNT = 1
MAX_CLUSTER_COUNT = 5
SCALING_POLICY = 'STANDARD';
