Strong Final Interview Answer

Generation 2 Multi-Cluster Warehouses are an improved Snowflake concurrency scaling architecture designed to reduce query queueing and improve cluster startup efficiency. Compared to Generation 1, Generation 2 provides faster provisioning, better workload distribution, improved concurrency handling, and more efficient resource utilization. These improvements reduce queued overload and provisioning delays, making Generation 2 better suited for large-scale BI and dashboard workloads with many simultaneous users.
